: {"x": 205.7070957449457, "y": 1852.6357593335867, "width": 133.56705688723335, "height": 18.317446907361234}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "• Documentation showing the receipt of payment, such as copies of the two most recent bank statements showing deposit amounts.", "bbox": {"x": 169.4577738761547, "y": 1869.8444069471013, "width": 1274.0246302355333, "height": 31.80647591749819}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Rental income:", "bbox": {"x": 151.21293777628034, "y": 1897.4999999641927, "width": 155.79514824797843, "height": 22.916666666666586}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Copy of the most recent filed federal tax return with all schedules, including Schedule E-Supplement Income and Loss. Rental income for qualifying purposes will be 75% of the gross rent you reported reduced by the monthly debt service on the property, if applicable; or", "bbox": {"x": 206.19946073730225, "y": 1915.833333327829, "width": 1365.4986522911051, "height": 50.41666666666673}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "- If rental income is not reported on Schedule E - Supplemental Income and Loss, provide a copy of the current lease agreement with either pank statements or canceled rent checks demonstrating receipt or rent.", "bbox": {"x": 174.12398898921828, "y": 1961.6666666624742, "width": 1370.0808625336927, "height": 41.24999999999985}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Copies of the two most recent investment statements or bank statements supporting receipt of this income.", "bbox": {"x": 206.19945864525965, "y": 2021.2499999402173, "width": 1053.9083557951483, "height": 27.4999999999999}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Copy of divorce decree, separation agreement, or other written legal agreement filed with a court, or court decree that states the amount of the alimony, child support, or separation maintenance payments and the period of time over which the payments will be received, and", "bbox": {"x": 206.1994606789082, "y": 2067.083333327681, "width": 1351.7520215633424, "height": 45.83333333333317}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "• Copies of vour two most recent bank statements or other third-party documents showing receipt of payment", "bbox": {"x": 169.54179598824143, "y": 2108.3333335741536, "width": 1085.9837575742822, "height": 18.333332786957392}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Notice: Alimony, child support, or separate maintenance income need not be revealed if you do not choose to have it considered for repaying", "bbox": {"x": 105.31715552002682, "y": 2131.175885095507, "width": 1438.9618248952368, "height": 32.083237171173096}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Fannie Mae/Freddie Mac Form 710", "bbox": {"x": 82.47978416906773, "y": 2177.083333317529, "width": 311.59029649595686, "height": 18.333333333333268}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Page 2 of 4", "bbox": {"x": 797.3045819811322, "y": 2177.083333295139, "width": 109.97304582210236, "height": 18.333333333333268}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "June 2014", "bbox": {"x": 1539.622641291779, "y": 2177.0833332875, "width": 96.2264150943396, "height": 18.333333333333268}}], "ms": 401.679625}